# This file defines individuals or teams responsible for code and documentation
# in specific parts of the repository. When a pull request modifies files in
# these areas, the designated owners are automatically requested for review.
#
# Syntax: path/to/files @github-username @github-team
#
# For more information: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

